&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; line-height: 16px"&gt;炭素税・排出権取引の導入&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 192px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; line-height: 16px"&gt;炭素税や排出権取引によるコスト増加&lt;/p&gt;
